From e33fc70b9066c9e8e77c94f1d0dfa8e3fb34a398 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:02:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): the Mazak preamble states G94

Every F word of the Mazak post is a feed per minute, but the post never
wrote G94: a control left in G95 by its power-on setting, an earlier
program or MDI read F1200 as 1200 per revolution. Each section preamble
now writes G17 G90 G94 <wcs> G40 G49 G80, as the Haas post does.

The 29 Mazak goldens change in their preamble line only.

Fixes #4343

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
